          ]
        },
        {
          "t": "txt",
          "args": [
            "(2<sup>2</sup>)<sup>3</sup>"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "lead": "Simplify each to a single power of 2.",
      "args": [
        "Product of powers: add exponents &rarr; 2⁵.",
        "Already simplified: 2⁵ = 32.",
        "Quotient of powers: subtract exponents &rarr; 2⁵.",
        "The impostor — power of a power: multiply exponents &rarr; 2⁶ = 64."
      ],
      "prompts": [
        "Simplify each. Three equal 2⁵ — which is different?",
        "Which exponent rule did you use for each box?"
      ]
